rtc_base/{openssl_stream_adapter.{h,cc},ssl_stream_adapter.cc} and
api/crypto/crypto_options.cc at webrtc-sdk/webrtc @
ba469aa2093ba950066258ca0a59a6fbd1295582 (fetched directly from
